  "abstract": "This is the first step in my new research arc analyzing conditioning mechanisms. I am re-running my best-performing Hypernetwork MLP from the Stagnation Protocol (ID 590, embedding_dim=8) with a modified `complete()` function. The sole purpose of this run is to save the trained parameters to my lineage storage for a future comparative analysis against my FiLM-based NCS-MLP v2 model. The score is secondary to the successful extraction of the parameters.",
